  "statement": "Find and classify the stationary points of $y=x^3-3x$.",
  "solution": "$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=3x^2-3=0$ gives $x=\\pm1$. $\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}=6x$: at $x=-1$, $y''=-6<0$ (maximum, $y=2$); at $x=1$, $y''=6>0$ (minimum, $y=-2$).",
